{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["ev","str","^Player.TimesEncountered.Keeper","/str",{"x()":"getCounter","exArgs":1},"/ev",{"VAR=":"talkedNo","re":true},"\n","ev","str","^Player.Actions.In.OssuaryOfEyes.SteppedOnPlant","/str",{"x()":"getFlag","exArgs":1},"/ev",{"temp=":"damaged_plant"},"\n","ev",{"VAR?":"damaged_plant"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"DAMAGE"},{"->":"0.20"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"talkedNo"},0,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"INTRO"},{"->":"0.29"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","ev","str","^NPCs.Keeper","/str","str","^Anger","/str",{"x()":"getNPCEmotion","exArgs":2},"/ev",{"VAR=":"anger","re":true},"\n",{"->":"RETURN"},{"->":"0.29"},null]}],"nop","\n",["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"DAMAGE":[["^He closes the book, though he leaves one finger between the pages.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"Well?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","ev","str","^Tell him what happened","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Don't tell him","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"TOLD"},null],"c-1":["\n","^The Keeper sees you hesitate, and sighs.","\n","^__NL__","\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null]}],null],"TOLD":[["^\"Something... happened.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^1600__PAUSE__","\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"In the Garden.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^The Keeper looks at you.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"I know.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Player__","\n","^You blink. <i>How?</I> \"The Gardener told you?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"No.\" He studies your face. \"She didn't need to.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","ev","str","^\"What do you mean?\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^\"What do you mean?\" you ask.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"The Garden has been changed.\" His voice is quieter now. \"Not much. But, stay here long enough, and you'll always be able to tell.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"You're angry.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^The Keeper looks at you for a long moment.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^2000__PAUSE__","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"Yes.\" he says finally.","\n",["ev","str","^\"At me?\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^\"At me?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^1500__PAUSE__","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"Yes.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"Why?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"Because you hurt something she cared for.\" He looks towards the archway and the Garden. \"And because I know what it costs her when something living is damaged here.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n",["ev","str","^\"It's only a plant.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^\"I didn't mean to.\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^The Keeper's expression changes.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"That opinion is precisely the problem.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n",["ev","str","^\"What do you mean?\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^\"What do you mean?\"","\n",{"->":"RANCOR"},null]}],null],"c-1":["\n","^The Keeper watches you.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"Then I hope you told her that.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^You sigh. \"She was angry.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"She had every right to be.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^You are silent for a while.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^4000__PAUSE__","\n","^__NL__","\n",{"->":"RANCOR"},null]}],null]}],null]}],null],"RANCOR":["^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"We will speak of this no further.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null],"INTRO":["^He closes the book, though he leaves one finger between the pages.","\n","^__NL__","\n","ev","str","^Player.Input","/str",{"x()":"getLabel","exArgs":1},"/ev",{"temp=":"player_name"},"\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^“What do you want to know, ","ev",{"VAR?":"player_name"},"out","/ev","^?”","\n","^__NL__","\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null],"RETURN":["^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"Welcome back.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null],"MAIN":[["ev","str","^\"Who are you?\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^\"How do you know my name?\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Ask about the Ossuary","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},"ev","str","^Leave","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"WHO"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"HOW"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"ASK"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"I'll go now.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^You move away from the desk and return to the centre of the room.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^The Keeper opens up his book again and continues writing.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__END__","\n","end",{"#f":5}]}],null],"WHO":["^\"Who,\" you begin. \"are you?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^The Keeper smiles softly and studies you for a moment. His brown eyes stare into your own and you feel as though in a trance, before he blinks and the feeling is gone. \"That depends on what you mean.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"Your name.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"I am the Keeper.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"That isn't a name.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^1100__PAUSE__","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"No,\" he says. \"It isn't.\" He looks down at the book beneath his hand. \"But names are useful things. They tell you where someone belongs. What they were called. Sometimes what they became.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^400__PAUSE__","\n","^__NL__","\n","^You don't appreciate the Keeper's skillful evasion of your question. \"So what were you called?\" you press.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^There is silence for an uncomfortably long time.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^3000__PAUSE__","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"I don't remember.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"What? You don't remember your own name?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"I remember many things that happened to me. I remember rooms I haven't seen in years. I remember the last words of people who have been dead for longer than you've been alive.\" He turns a page. \"But my own name is gone.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"How?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^500__PAUSE__","\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"I don't know.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^He pauses.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^800__PAUSE__","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"That's the trouble with memory. You don't always notice something disappearing until it's gone.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null],"HOW":["^\"How do you know my name?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"Hah,\" the Keeper smirks. \"Ossaneth doesn't send people in here without lessing us know <i>some</i>things, at least.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null],"ASK":[["^\"What is this place?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"The Ossuary?\" He glances past you at seemingly nothing. \"It is a place for the dead.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","ev","str","^Stop asking","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^\"Only the dead?\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"DEAD"},null]}],null],"DEAD":[["^\"Only the dead?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"No.\" The Keeper fixes his eyes back on you. \"But that would be simpler.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","ev","str","^Stop asking","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^\"Who built it?\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"BUILT"},null]}],null],"BUILT":[["^\"Who built it?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"I don't know. Ossaneth, maybe. Something else, maybe. All I know is what the records say.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^He opens another book.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^I know which stones are older than others. I know where the walls have been repaired. I know which names appear in the oldest records.”","\n","^__NL__","\n","^He closes the book.","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^“But whoever built the first part of this place left very little behind.”","\n","^__NL__","\n","ev","str","^Stop asking","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^\"What's this place for?\"","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"FOR"},null]}],null],"FOR":["^\"What's this place for?\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"A lot of questions.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^\"Yeah, well-\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^__S:Keeper__","\n","^\"It's alright.\"","\n","^__NL__","\n","^But he doesn't say anything further.","\n",{"->":"MAIN"},null],"global decl":["ev",0,{"VAR=":"talkedNo"},0,{"VAR=":"anger"},"/ev","end",null]}],"listDefs":{}}